cc-ledger
=========

This project adapts code from:

  cc-statusline-rs — https://github.com/khoi/cc-statusline-rs
  Copyright (c) khoi
  Licensed under the MIT License.

Specifically, `src/render.rs` adapts that project's status-line presentation:

  * the Nerd Font icon choices, ANSI colour palette and segment separator;
  * the context-usage colour thresholds (50% / 70% / 90%) and the ten-cell
    block bar;
  * the `fish_shorten_path`, `truncate_middle`, `format_tokens` and
    `format_cost` helpers, and their tests.

The MIT License as distributed with cc-statusline-rs is reproduced in full
below. This project's own licence grant, also MIT, is in LICENSE — kept to that
one licence text so automated classifiers report the project correctly.

Everything else — the transcript reader, the dedupe scheme, the SQLite ledger,
the rate-limit history and the `cc-usage` CLI — is original to this project.


